{'symbol': 'PCG', 'date': '2019-12-19 19:30:00', 'title': 'PG&E SAYS ON DEC 19, CPUC APPROVED REVISED PROPOSED DECISION, MAINTAINING UTILITY’S ROE FOR 3-YEAR PERIOD BEGINNING JAN 1, 2020 AT 10.25%', 'text': 'PG&E SAYS ON DEC 19, CPUC APPROVED REVISED PROPOSED DECISION, MAINTAINING UTILITY’S ROE FOR 3-YEAR PERIOD BEGINNING JAN 1, 2020 AT 10.25% -SEC FILING.PG&E - CPUC DECISION MAINTAINS COMMON EQUITY COMPONENT OF UTILITY’S CAPITAL STRUCTURE AT 52%, AS REQUESTED BY UTILITY.PG&E - CPUC DECISION REDUCES ITS PREFERRED STOCK COMPONENT FROM 1% TO 0.5%, ALSO AS REQUESTED BY UTILITY.PG&E - CPUC DECISION ALSO APPROVES THE COST OF DEBT REQUESTED BY THE UTILITY.PG&E - UTILITY HAD REQUESTED RETURN ON COMMON EQUITY FOR THREE-YEAR PERIOD BEGINNING JAN 1, 2020 AT 12%.'}